  "name": "Lucario and the Mystery of Mew theatrical release",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Lucario and the Mystery of Mew opened across Japan on 16 July 2005, and its first 3.5 million viewers each got one of three cards at random, Regice, Regirock or Registeel 098-100/PCG-P, the three Pokémon who play a big part in the film, with one of three keychains. Each card came with an entry form for a draw of 1,000 Nintendo DS Mew Editions from Pokémon Center. All three are credited to 2005 Pikachu Project.",
